  "own_original_text": "Executive Order 12392 of November 15, 1982\nInternational Financial Institutions\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and statutes of  \nthe United States of America, including Section 301 of Title 3 of the United  \nStates Code, and in order to assign to the Secretary of the Treasury the  \nauthority to make payments to certain international financial institutions, it is  \nhereby ordered that the functions vested in the President by Section 129 of  \nPublic Law 97-276 (October 2, 1982) are delegated to the Secretary of the  \nTreasury.\nTHE WHITE HOUSE,  \nN ovem ber 15, 1982.\n[FR Doc. 82-31705 \nFiled 11-18-82; 10:06 am]",
